We've fixed some bugs. Check it out:

Patch 1.0.4a

[list]
[*] The bug in which the ancient medallion wasn't unlocked in the Extra menu has been fixed;
[*] Some misspelling has been fixed;
[*] Messages about Solo Ending A and Solo Ending B were appearing in the wrong positions;
[*] There was an extra frame in one of Grivoth's NSFW gallery in a scene it shouldn't have;
[/list]
Guide 1.0.2
[list]
[*] There were some wrong lines in Bad Ending #6. Now, they have been fixed;
[/list]
Male Doll Team

This patch includes small changes we made in 1.0.1a, but new bugs have been fixed. Check out what has changed.

[list]
[*] The NSFW Gallery has been fixed;
[*] Small improvements have been done;
[*] UI Interfaces have been fixed;
[*] Now, if you download the DLC, uninstall it, and load an old save, the game will not crash;
[/list]
Male Doll Team
